  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okujeema kwa Mowaabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogw'ekkumi n'omunaana ogw'obwakabaka bwa Yekosafaati kabaka wa Yuda, Yekolaamu mutabani wa Akabu n'alya obwakabaka bwa Isirayiri e Samaliya, era n'afugira emyaka kkumi n'ebiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakola ebibi mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", newaakubadde nga teyatuuka ku bibi bya kitaawe ne nnyina. Yazikiriza n'empagi eya Baali kitaawe gye yali asimbye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaakubadde ng'ekyo yakikola, teyalekayo kukola ebibi ng'ebyo Yerobowaamu mutabani wa Nebati bye yakola, n'ayonoonyesa Isirayiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesa Kabaka wa Mowaabu yalundanga endiga, era yalina omutemwa ogw'okuwangayo abaana b'endiga emitwalo kkumi, n'ebyoya by'endiga ennume emitwalo kkumi eri Akabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Akabu olwafa, kabaka wa Mowaabu n'atandika okujeemera kabaka wa Isirayiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo mu biro ebyo kabaka Yekolaamu n'asitula okuva e Samaliya, n'akunga Isirayiri yenna okugenda naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'atumira ne Yekosafaati kabaka wa Yuda nti, \"Kabaka wa Mowaabu anjeemedde, onooyinza okumbeera tumulwanyise?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 3:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yekosafaati n'amuddamu nti, \"Nnaagenda naawe, kubanga nze ndi nga bw'oli, era abantu bange be bantu bo, n'embalaasi zange ze zizo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yekosafaati n'amubuuza nti, \"Ye, tunaalumba kuva ku luuyi ki?\" Yekolaamu n'amuddamu nti, \"Tunaayita mu ddungu erya Edomu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo kabaka wa Isirayiri, n'asitukira wamu ne kabaka wa Yuda ne kabaka wa Edomu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bagenda mu lutalo. Ne batambula olugendo lwa nnaku musanvu, n'oluvannyuma ne beesanga ng'eggye amazzi galiweddeko, nga n'ebisolo byabwe tebirina wadde ettondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka wa Isirayiri ne yeekanga nnyo. N'ayogera nti, \"Zitusanze! Ffenna abasatu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atuwaddeyo mu mukono gwa Mowaabu?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyokka Yekosafaati n'abuuza nti, \"Tewali wano nnabbi wa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tumwebuuzeeko?\" Awo omu ku bakungu ba kabaka wa Isirayiri n'amuddamu nti, \"Wano waliwo Erisa mutabani wa Safati. Ye yali omuweereza wa Eriya ow'oku mwanjo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yekosafaati n'ayogera nti, \"Alina ekigambo okuva eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\" Awo Yekosafaati kabaka wa Yuda, awamu ne kabaka wa Isirayiri, ne kabaka wa Edomu ne baserengeta gy'ali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Erisa n'agamba kabaka wa Isirayiri nti, \"Onnanga ki? Genda eri bannabbi ba kitaawo n'aba maama wo.\" Kabaka wa Isirayiri n'amuddamu nti, \"Nedda sijja kugendayo; kubanga kirabika nga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atukuŋŋaanyiza ffensatule, okutuwaayo mu mukono gwa Mowaabu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erisa n'ayogera nti, \"Nga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda Ayinzabyonna gwe mpeereza bw'ali omulamu, singa nnali siwa Yekosafaati kabaka wa Yuda kitiibwa, sandikukubyeko munye ya liiso wadde okukusaako omwoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye kaakano, mundeetere omukubi w'ennanga.\" Omukubi w'ennanga bwe yali ng'akyakuba ennanga, amaanyi ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne gakka ku Erisa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ayogera nti, \"Bw'ati bw'ayogera",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nti, 'Musime ensalosalo mu kiwonvu kino.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agamba nti, 'Temuulabe mbuyaga wadde enkuba, naye ekiwonvu kino kijja kujjula amazzi, era mmwe munaanywa, n'ente zammwe zinaanywa, n'ebisolo byammwe ebirala nabyo binywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo nsonga nnyangu mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.3.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.3.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", era n'Abamowaabu mujja kubawangula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulizikiriza buli kibuga ekyetooloddwa bbugwe na buli kibuga ekikulu, era mulitema buli muti omulungi, ne muziyiza n'enzizi okuleeta amazzi, era ne mwonoona buli nnimiro nga mugijjuza amayinja.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo obudde bwe bwakya, mu kiseera eky'okuweerayo ssaddaaka, amazzi ne gakulukuta nga gava ku luuyi olwa Edomu, ensi n'ejjula amazzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamowaabu bonna bwe baawulira nga bakabaka babalumbye okulwana nabo, buli musajja, omuto n'omukulu abaali basobola okwambala ebyokulwanyisa, ne bayitibwa okugenda okutabaala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkeera enjuba bwe yayaka ku mazzi, Abamowaabu ne balowooza nti amazzi mamyufu kubanga gaabalabikira ng'omusaayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bagamba nti, \"Guno musaayi! Kirabika nga bakabaka baalwanye bokka ne bokka, ne battiŋŋana, kale Mowaabu mugwe ku munyago.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Abamowaabu bwe baali nga baakayingira mu nkambi y'Abayisirayiri, amangwago Abayisirayiri ne batandika okulwana nabo, okutuusa Abamowaabu lwe badduka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bamenyaamenya ebibuga by'Abamowaabu, ne bakanyuga amayinja ku buli kibanja ekirungi okutuusa lwe gaakolangako entuumo; ne baziba enzizi zonna ez'amazzi, ne batema na buli muti omulungi. Kirukalesesi kye kifo kyokka ekyali kitalumbiddwa, naye oluvannyuma abasajja ab'envuumuulo ne bakirumba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo kabaka wa Mowaabu bwe yalaba ng'olutalo lumugendedde bubi, n'atwala abasajja ab'ebitala lusanvu, ne bagenda naye okulumba kabaka wa Edomu, kyokka ne balemelerwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'addira mutabani we omuggulanda, eyali ateekwa okumusikira, n'amuweerayo ku bbugwe w'ekibuga ng'ekiweebwayo ekyokebwa. Abayisirayiri ne beesisiwala nnyo ne beetamwa, era ne baddayo mu nsi yaabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
